FINDINGS
--------
1. THE BLOW-UP IS A2d (MYDUMP), NOTHING ELSE. With the 24-phase binary the true
   residue A2r is 0.01-0.06 s in EVERY cell -- negligible at any np, any cadence.
   The old "A2r explodes" was 100% MYDUMP I/O hiding inside the old 7-term
   residue. Confirmed at the sub-phase level.

2. io0 (per-rank dirs) IS the artifact. A2d climbs ~0.6 s (np1) -> 8.4 s
   (asis np8) / 10.4 s (adj4x np8): a ~14x blow-up = 8-way shared-disk
   contention from all 8 ranks writing the full COMMON dump. This is a property
   of the TEST harness, never of production.

3. THE PRODUCTION GUARD ERASES IT. Under io1 (NBODY_RANK0_IO=1, shared dir,
   only rank 0 writes) A2d at np8 = 0.600 s (asis) / 0.746 s (adj4x) -- i.e.
   IDENTICAL to np1 (0.595 / 0.680). MYDUMP is np-invariant in production.

4. ADJUST TOTAL AT np8 ~= np1 IN PRODUCTION.
   asis : A2 np8 io1 = 9.20 s ~= np1 8.95 s  (io0's 17.23 s was the +8 s of
          MYDUMP contention).
   adj4x: A2 np8 io1 = 5.45 s ~= np1 5.06 s  (io0's 15.26 s, likewise).
   ADJUST does NOT degrade with rank count under the production I/O guard.

5. WHAT THE ADJUST WALL ACTUALLY IS (io1, production):
   A2 = A2o OUTPUT-in-ADJUST (~4.1-8.3 s, file I/O, np-invariant)
      + A1 ENERGY2/GPUPOT (already MPI-decomposed, C1; scales -- 0.018 s here)
      + A2d MYDUMP restart dump (~0.6-0.7 s, rank-0-only, np-invariant)
      + A2e ESCAPE 0.03-0.07 s, A2k CHECK ~0, A2x/A2s/A2c/A2l < 0.2 s, A2r ~0.
   Every non-trivial term is either np-invariant rank-0 I/O (OUTPUT + MYDUMP)
   or already decomposed (ENERGY2). There is no replicated O(N)/O(N^2) compute
   left to parallelise.

6. GUARD HYGIENE (io1 np8): exactly one PHASE TIMERS table, one END RUN, banner
   "Rank-0 I/O guard active" present, single rank-0 file inventory (no rank>0
   fort.* leakage). The production launch pattern is clean.

CONCLUSION  -- G2 CLOSED: nothing to cut in ADJUST
--------------------------------------------------
The A2-A1 residue is dominated by rank-0-only restart-dump (MYDUMP/A2d) and
diagnostic OUTPUT (A2o) -- both np-invariant file I/O in production. The np8
"A2r explosion" reported on 2026-06-16 was entirely an artifact of the per-rank
-dir test harness (NBODY_RANK0_IO=0) forcing 8-way MYDUMP disk contention; it
disappears under the production guard. No parallelisation of ADJUST internals
is warranted. The remaining serial ADJUST cost (OUTPUT/MYDUMP I/O) is inherent
to writing snapshots and can only be reduced by writing less often / async I/O,
not by rank decomposition. Roadmap item 1 (G2) is done.

Reproduce:
  cd mpi_design/poc_validation && ./run_io_mode.sh            # mpi-gpu (default)
  BIN=$(ls ../../GPU2/run_*/nbody7b.mpi-cpu) ./run_io_mode.sh  # mpi-cpu cross-check
